o Batel, Mercês e Bigorrilho, cercado pelos melhores serviços, gastronomia e conveniências de Curitiba.\n\nUm apartamento para quem busca exclusividade, conforto e soluções que realmente fazem diferença na rotina.\n\nEntre em contato e descubra por que o Verdigris é um dos empreendimentos mais especiais de Curitiba.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/72ebf872-014c-4391-bf06-8758b3928d82.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3fbfd52f-2a1f-46be-a009-f12bef2937e4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fd9c26ce-dcd9-400b-b9dd-0f4b3e1d7c25.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/20693bbb-8330-42dd-9050-fa2cf8bdf905.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a12e316a-0cd5-4951-9f5a-a1be9a66df4c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5e9af910-c302-490e-8415-a54f616b89cd.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b3b7a759-14a8-4923-911f-1d9bd8ca2b88.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/21ecd6ee-22cd-4db3-836d-ebfdbc5d37d9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a91e4b6b-9ed9-4398-b62c-65697bd3f6b7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/408a1811-cf71-4a11-bcbf-047fe0a4112b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a37f14afaca054574dd5d90/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1b7acaaf-ea25-404c-ae69-6ccc6aaece8e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbo